OL,3,GNEWSA'Some taxi drivers feel CCTV
OL,4,Ainvades privacy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaxi drivers in part of Shropshire have
OL,7,Fshown a reluctance to have free CCTV
OL,8,Fput in their vehicles due to privacy
OL,9,Fworries when the vehicles are used as
OL,10,Fpersonal family cars, a meeting heard.
OL,12,FForty-eight licensed private hire
OL,13,Fvehicles and hackney carriages have had
OL,14,Fsafety cameras fitted since a scheme
OL,15,Fwas launched in 2022, funded by Telford
OL,16,F& Wrekin borough's community safety
OL,17,Fpartnership.
OL,19,FWith about 400 licences in the borough,
OL,20,Findependent councillor Peter Scott
OL,21,Fasked if there was "any reason some
OL,22,Fdon't" take it up.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
