OL,3,GNEWSA'Some taxi drivers feel CCTV
OL,4,Ainvades privacy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council official said: "Some of the
OL,7,Ftaxi drivers don't feel comfortable
OL,8,Fhaving CCTV on because they think it
OL,9,Fwould record every journey and they
OL,10,Ffeel it's an invasion of privacy."
